WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.190
You switch off a light
to stop wasting energy.

2
00:00:03.240 --> 00:00:06.530
But energy can never
be made or destroyed.

3
00:00:06.580 --> 00:00:09.870
So what does using energy really mean?

4
00:00:09.920 --> 00:00:11.410
Think about your breakfast.

5
00:00:11.460 --> 00:00:13.730
It gets you up the stairs to class.

6
00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.490
Where is that energy now?

7
00:00:15.540 --> 00:00:16.970
Is any of it gone?

8
00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:20.310
In this mission, you'll meet the
eight stores that hold energy,

9
00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:23.570
and the four ways energy
can be transferred.

10
00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:26.530
You'll see how a push
or a lift does work.

11
00:00:26.580 --> 00:00:30.210
And you'll find out how a lever
lets a small push lift a heavy

12
00:00:30.260 --> 00:00:31.350
rock.

13
00:00:31.400 --> 00:00:35.770
Your mission: explain what really
happens when you use energy.
